X: 1
T: Let Us Ever Walk With Jesus
C: Words: Sigmund von Birken, 1652.  Translated by J. Adam Rimbach, 1900.
C: Music: 'Lasset Uns Mit Jesu Ziehen (Boltze)' or 'Walk With Jesus' or 'Let Us Ever Walk With Jesus'
C: Gabriel Gottlieb Boltze, 1788.  Setting: "The American Lutheran Hymnal", 1930.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music source: "The American Lutheran Hymnal", 1930 Hymn 220
S: Lyrics source: from The Handbook to the Lutheran Hymnal, 1942  https://www.projectwittenberg.org/etext/hymnals/tlh/ever_walk.txt  Note that the text of this hymn from the Handbook to the Lutheran Hymnal is available on Project Wittenberg, operated by the Walther Library of Concordia Theological Seminary Fort Wayne and the text is listed as public domain.  
